      "body": "Hello\nI'm a new mod developer working on a Minecraft Forge 1.20.1 mod. I really appreciate your work on this mod, it's a fantastic library.\nCurrently I can play, pause and stop audio with ALAudioClip, but I'm missing two common playback features:\nA method to get the total duration of the audio file\nA method to seek to a specific playback position and get position\nThese functions would help me implement music control and simple playback progress features in my mod.\nCould you please consider adding the following methods?",
